WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.640
This thing is ranked number one on GitHub right now.

00:02.640 --> 00:03.640
It's completely free.

00:03.640 --> 00:05.600
And almost nobody has set this up yet.

00:05.600 --> 00:06.480
So here's the deal.

00:06.480 --> 00:07.560
It's called Rooflo.

00:07.560 --> 00:11.200
And basically what it does is it spins up 60 plus AI agents

00:11.200 --> 00:13.560
that all work together to build whatever you want.

00:13.560 --> 00:16.680
And they actually get better after every single run.

00:16.680 --> 00:17.560
Pretty freaking cool.

00:17.560 --> 00:19.600
So you've got queen agents that manage the teams

00:19.600 --> 00:22.840
and tactical agents that handle all the actual work.

00:22.840 --> 00:25.800
Researching, coding, testing, reviewing, all of it.

00:25.800 --> 00:27.600
And they all share a collective memory

00:27.600 --> 00:28.800
so they improve over time.

00:28.800 --> 00:30.520
But here's the thing that makes this insane.

00:30.520 --> 00:33.200
It figures out how complex your task is

00:33.200 --> 00:35.760
and routes it to the right model automatically.

00:35.760 --> 00:38.880
Simple task goes to a cheap model, complicated task

00:38.880 --> 00:40.240
goes to a powerful one.

00:40.240 --> 00:42.680
So you can cut your token usage by up to 50%

00:42.680 --> 00:45.840
and extend your cloud code usage by 250%.

00:45.840 --> 00:46.720
That's nuts.

00:46.720 --> 00:48.560
It's open source, completely free,

00:48.560 --> 00:50.800
and ranked number one on GitHub, not bad.

00:50.800 --> 00:52.280
Drop flow in the comments

00:52.280 --> 00:54.240
and I'll send you the full setup guide.

